</span></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=highlight><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code class=language-csharp data-lang=csharp><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=kt>var</span> <span class=n>collectionInfo</span> <span class=p>=</span> <span class=k>await</span> <span class=n>client</span><span class=p>.</span><span class=n>GetCollectionInfoAsync</span><span class=p>(</span><span class=s>&#34;{collection_name}&#34;</span><span class=p>);</span>
